Z||000004||FieroBUZZ||07-17-2001||05:37 PM||||I was able to use a small die grinder to notch the nut and an air hammer to force it to turn off.  You could use a grinder to flatten one side, being careful not to ruin the threads if they're still okay, and then turn it with a hammer and chisel.<BR>Gary<BR>||||reg||8
